id           = CWE-1043
name         = Data Element Aggregating an Excessively Large Number of Non-Primitive Elements
abstraction  = Base
structure    = Simple
status       = Incomplete

description : The product uses a data element that has an excessively large number of sub-elements with non-primitive data types such as structures or aggregated objects.

extended description : While the interpretation of "excessively large" may vary for each product or developer, CISQ recommends a default of 5 sub-elements.

notes : https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1043.html
